    "Id": "vehicledef_HUNTER_LRM10",
    "Name": "Hunter HNT-3RS",
    "Details": "This 2954 variant downgrades to an LRM-10 with two tons of ammo. The space left over is filled two forward facing medium lasers and two machine guns in each side. The Hunter Light Support Tank is popular with planetary militias and second-line units. It was designed by Defiance Industries as a cheap, reliable and effective combat vehicle to provide covering fire support for combat units withdrawing from the front lines. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       180     20\n<b>Left</b>         120     20\n<b>Right</b>       120     20\n<b>Rear</b>         80     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      500     80</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
    "Icon": "Hunter"
